{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f <strong>YAARRGH! Battle Island!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Pirate Fueled Co-op Sandbox Survival Adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/RumbleBI.png?t=1746013023\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Welcome to Battle Island</strong>: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A wild, procedurally generated 3D island overrun by skeleton hordes, cursed kings, and hidden treasure! In this stylized pirate fantasy battle arena, you'll need grit, teamwork, and a good swing o\u2019 the cutlass to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skeleton armies rise from the earth to conquer the island, and only you and your crew can stop them. Fight off endless waves of bone rattling enemies in fast paced, skill based melee combat. Work together, defend the island, and take down the dreaded Skeleton King. When the dust settles (for a day), it\u2019s your chance to <strong>loot, mine, build, and prepare for the next invasion!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/CallToAction.gif?t=1746013023\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beautiful Procedural Islands,\u00a0</strong>Smoothly blended terrain, stylized 3D environments, and vibrant textures bring Battle Island to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddf1 <strong> Survival Elements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MINE:</strong> For treasure and rare ores across the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUILD:</strong> Everything from huts to massive fortresses or hidden bunkers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CRAFT:</strong>\u00a0Weapons, armor, and gear from a wide variety of resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Combat System</strong><br>A brand new pirate melee system with a focus on skill based swordplay, punchy feedback, and a splash of cartoonish chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CO-OP Multiplayer:</strong> Defend the island with your crew against waves of AI skeletons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Private or Public:</strong> Host a local session for friends or open it up to the world!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Stylized Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bright, bold textures, charming character models, and explosive toony particle effects make every battle pop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2693 <strong>Join the Crew!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re constantly updating the game with new features, bug fixes, and content. Jump in now to get early access, join the growing pirate community, and help shape the future of <strong>YAARRGH! Battle Island!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Development\u2019s Full Steam Ahead!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re hard at work getting <strong>YAARRGH! Battle Island!</strong> ready for launch. Want a sneak peek behind the scenes? <strong>Follow our journey on YouTube</strong> and stay up to date with new features and pirate fuelled chaos! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1612750?t=1746013023","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/110c50be2886be03e7dadf1dd1bf3a8c9b89458b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746013023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/099c1f8e7fdf22a2e78b7f3a9d96e9fc3842ff61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746013023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/099c1f8e7fdf22a2e78b7f3a9d96e9fc3842ff61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746013023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f <strong>YAARRGH! Battle Island!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Pirate Fueled Co-op Sandbox Survival Adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/RumbleBI.png?t=1746013023\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Welcome to Battle Island</strong>: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A wild, procedurally generated 3D island overrun by skeleton hordes, cursed kings, and hidden treasure! In this stylized pirate fantasy battle arena, you'll need grit, teamwork, and a good swing o\u2019 the cutlass to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skeleton armies rise from the earth to conquer the island, and only you and your crew can stop them. Fight off endless waves of bone rattling enemies in fast paced, skill based melee combat. Work together, defend the island, and take down the dreaded Skeleton King. When the dust settles (for a day), it\u2019s your chance to <strong>loot, mine, build, and prepare for the next invasion!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/CallToAction.gif?t=1746013023\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beautiful Procedural Islands,\u00a0</strong>Smoothly blended terrain, stylized 3D environments, and vibrant textures bring Battle Island to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddf1 <strong> Survival Elements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MINE:</strong> For treasure and rare ores across the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUILD:</strong> Everything from huts to massive fortresses or hidden bunkers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CRAFT:</strong>\u00a0Weapons, armor, and gear from a wide variety of resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Combat System</strong><br>A brand new pirate melee system with a focus on skill based swordplay, punchy feedback, and a splash of cartoonish chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CO-OP Multiplayer:</strong> Defend the island with your crew against waves of AI skeletons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Private or Public:</strong> Host a local session for friends or open it up to the world!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Stylized Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bright, bold textures, charming character models, and explosive toony particle effects make every battle pop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2693 <strong>Join the Crew!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re constantly updating the game with new features, bug fixes, and content. Jump in now to get early access, join the growing pirate community, and help shape the future of <strong>YAARRGH! Battle Island!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Development\u2019s Full Steam Ahead!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re hard at work getting <strong>YAARRGH! Battle Island!</strong> ready for launch. Want a sneak peek behind the scenes? <strong>Follow our journey on YouTube</strong> and stay up to date with new features and pirate fuelled chaos! </p>","developers":["GreedyVox"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/171653155d0e6d02393f6902c0660161c0786fa5/header.jpg?t=1746013023","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-3570K CPU @ 3.40GHz \u00d7 4<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 760<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu Latest Release<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257067535,"mp4